'''Necropolis''' is the alternative chapter of The {{s|Depths}}. It is a dark environment infested with insects, with common enemies including Masks + Heart, Swarmers, and Hangers.

Necropolis is unlocked by defeating every [[boss]] from The {{s|Depths}} at least once.

The boss of Necropolis II is always {{e|Mom}}.

{{dlc+|r}} After {{a|A Secret Exit}} is unlocked, a door will appear in Necropolis I's {{r|Boss Room}} upon defeating the boss, leading to the {{S|Mausoleum}} / {{S|Gehenna}}. This door requires two hearts to be opened (except on Lost characters). Unlike {{r|Angel Room}}s and {{r|Devil Room}}s, this door never disappears. Also after this achievement is unlocked, [[a Strange Door]] in the starting room of Necropolis II will appear. This door leads to {{S|Mausoleum}} / {{S|Gehenna}} II before entering the [[Ascent]].
