== Trivia ==
* A [[wikipedia:Necropolis|necropolis]] is a large ancient cemetery with elaborate tomb monuments. In Ancient Greek, νεκρόπολις or ''nekropolis'' literally means "city of the dead".
* In the original ''The Binding of Isaac'', {{e|Daddy Long Legs}}, {{e|Triachnid}}, {{e|Carrion Queen}}, and {{e|The Wretched}} could appear as bosses.

== Music ==
* The [[music]] for Necropolis is titled ''When Blood Dries''.<ref>[https://ridiculon.bandcamp.com/album/the-binding-of-isaac-rebirth-ost Binding of Isaac: Rebirth OST]</ref>

